# Allowlist: the image needs only the lock inputs, the package and its configs. Everything else stays out
# of the build context (work/, .venv/, models/, tiles, tests, reports, coverage and tool caches, secrets).
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!.python-version
!vineyard
!configs

# Re-excluded inside the allowlisted folders.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
configs/local.yaml
configs/*.local.yaml
